flowchart LR
  task["Approved task need"] --> registry["Tool / MCP capability registry"]
  registry --> policy["Check identity, scope, data and side-effect policy"]
  policy --> decision{"Least privilege and allowed?"}
  decision -->|No| deny["Stop and report required access"]
  decision -->|Yes| adapter["Connector adapter · future capability"]
